OL,3,AHeating bills, chocolate and cat food: 
OL,4,AWhat the inflation figures mean for you
OL,6,FNobody will be celebrating the fact    
OL,7,Fthat prices in the UK are rising at the
OL,8,Ffastest pace for a year.               
OL,10,FAdd to that an expectation of higher   
OL,11,Fhousehold energy bills and sharpening  
OL,12,Fprice increases and things look grim   
OL,13,Ffor everyone.                          
OL,15,FBut there are some signs of hope that  
OL,16,Fmay take the edge off the rising cost  
OL,17,Fof living. Here's how.                 
OL,19,FThat headline is not missing a decimal 
OL,20,Fpoint. The latest prediction for the   
OL,21,Fincrease in domestic energy prices in  
OL,22,Fthe new year is, indeed, 26%.          
